ILANG
TYPE:config PROJECT:vps-deals LANG:zh

::STATE{@SITE, brand:vps-deals, niche:vps hosting, title:VPS Deals Radar, tagline:Prices read straight from each provider's own public page and refreshed every six hours, locale:en-US, currency:USD, domain:vpsdealsradar.com, repo:https://github.com/wcsnm22/vps-deals-promo-radar, max_price:5000, lookback_lines:12}

::MODULE{PROVIDERS|title:抓哪几家 这里改了站就变}
  # 每行: 名称 | 官网 | 优惠页(或 sitemap/feed 地址) | 联盟链接(留空则用裸链) | kind=page|feed|sitemap | currency=USD|EUR
  # 加一家删一家只改这里 不用碰任何代码
  OVHcloud | https://www.ovhcloud.com | https://www.ovhcloud.com/en/vps/ |  | kind=page | currency=USD
  netcup | https://www.netcup.com | https://www.netcup.com/en/server/vps |  | kind=page | currency=EUR
  DigitalOcean | https://www.digitalocean.com | https://www.digitalocean.com/pricing |  | kind=page | currency=USD
  BuyVM | https://buyvm.net | https://buyvm.net/kvm-dedicated-server-slices/ |  | kind=page | currency=USD
  IONOS | https://www.ionos.com | https://www.ionos.com/servers/vps |  | kind=page | currency=USD
  Hetzner | https://www.hetzner.com | https://www.hetzner.com/cloud/ |  | kind=page | currency=EUR

::MODULE{FIELDS|title:每条优惠提取什么 抓不到就不写这个字段}
  title price currency offer_url valid_until source_url fetched_at

::MODULE{TITLEHINT|title:出现这些词的行才像产品名}
  vps vserver virtual server cloud server kvm slice plan starter business premium plus pro basic dedicated cpanel windows linux unmetered
  # 中文站也可以加词 例如 云服务器 主机 套餐

::MODULE{SPECWORD|title:出现这些词说明是规格参数 不是产品名}
  gb tb mb ram ddr ecc vcore vcpu core cores ssd nvme cpu gbps mbps bandwidth traffic snapshot backup ipv4 ipv6

::MODULE{FILLER|title:这些整行是填充文字 不能当标题}
  from details per month per month from starting at price see plans configure order now learn more more details buy now get started view
  the price per gb is traffic included unlimited traffic remote console and much more snapshots copy-on-write incl vat vat new key cloud info benefits
  cookie preferences privacy policy follow us

::MODULE{SKIPPRICE|title:和价格同一行出现这些词 说明这不是套餐月费 不要这条}
  per hour hourly /hour setup fee for your cloud startup program ipv4 address ipv6 address additional ip ssl certificate cpanel license
  # 注意 vat tax 不算 因为正常月费也会标含税

::MODULE{EXCLUDE|title:标题里出现这些整句就丢掉}
  cookie privacy newsletter javascript login sign in sign up copyright all rights reserved follow us
  ipv4 address ipv6 address additional ip startup program for your cloud
  options compatible advantages of ddos protection iso 27001 kvm console see plans email 2.0

::RULE{抓不到 price⇒这条不写 price 字段 也不写进结构化数据 不许拿估的填}
::RULE{找不到可信产品名⇒这条不收录 宁缺毋滥 不许拿规格行或填充词冒充产品名}
::RULE{valid_until 已过⇒标记过期或下架 不许留着冒充有效}
::RULE{抓取前读 robots.txt⇒Disallow 的路径直接跳过 并写进抓取报告}
::RULE{只抓公开页面⇒不登录 不绕反爬 不伪装登录态 关掉 gzip 只请求一次}
::RULE{运行时零推理零密钥⇒抓取和渲染都是确定性 Python 不调用任何模型}
::BOUNDARY{never:编优惠 编价格 编佣金|scope:permanent}
